OL,3,GNEWSAAviary needs #1.34m upgrade to    
OL,4,Ameet 'basic' welfare standards, council
OL,5,Asays                                   
OL,7,FAn aviary saved from closure after     
OL,8,Fcampaigners launched legal action could
OL,9,Fcost taxpayers more than a million     
OL,10,Fpounds to meet "basic" animal welfare  
OL,11,Fstandards, a council report has        
OL,12,Fconcluded.                             
OL,14,FSefton Council had planned to close the
OL,15,Faviary in the Botanic Gardens in       
OL,16,FChurchtown, Southport, but later       
OL,17,Frescinded the decision, saying the cost
OL,18,Fof fighting the legal challenge would  
OL,19,Fbe an unnecessary burden on taxpayers. 
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
