OL,3,GNEWSAAviary needs #1.34m upgrade to    
OL,4,Ameet 'basic' welfare standards, council
OL,5,Asays                                   
OL,7,FAn independent appraisal found the     
OL,8,Fsite, including its indoor and outdoor 
OL,9,Faccommodation, would need to almost    
OL,10,Fdouble in size, with annual running    
OL,11,Fcosts expected to exceed #80,000.      
OL,13,FThe council said a managed closure     
OL,14,Fremained one of the most appropriate   
OL,15,Foptions, while campaigners said their  
OL,16,Fpriority was securing a sustainable    
OL,17,Ffuture for the aviary.                 
